{"id":10127,"name":"wishiwashi-school","speciesId":746,"dex":746,"form":"other","generation":7,"types":["water"],"stats":{"hp":45,"attack":140,"defense":130,"special-attack":140,"special-defense":135,"speed":30},"abilities":[{"name":"schooling","hidden":false}],"height":82,"weight":786,"baseExp":217,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10127.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10127.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10127.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10127.ogg","genus":"Small Fry Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Frito Pequeno","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"When it’s in trouble, its eyes moisten and begin to shine. The shining light attracts its comrades, and they stand together against their enemies."},{"version":"moon","text":"It’s awfully weak and notably tasty, so everyone is always out to get it. As it happens, anyone trying to bully it receives a painful lesson."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"They’re weak, so they move in schools. However, they can also often be seen all alone, having strayed from the school."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"When it’s in a jam, its shining eyes attract others of its kind. The light from its eyes is visible almost 25 miles away."},{"version":"sword","text":"Individually, they’re incredibly weak. It’s by gathering up into schools that they’re able to confront opponents."},{"version":"shield","text":"When it senses danger, its eyes tear up. The sparkle of its tears signals other Wishiwashi to gather."}],"flavorPt":"Quando sente o perigo, seus olhos lacrimejam. O brilho de suas lágrimas sinaliza para outros Wishiwashi se reunirem.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":60,"eggGroups":["water2"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"wishiwashi","spe